## 📊 Progress Monitoring

### Real-time Tracking

As each step executes, maintain a live status table in your context:
| Step | Status | Agent | Started | Completed | Result |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 1 | ✅ DONE | executor | 14:01 | 14:02 | 文件已创建 |
| 2 | 🔄 RUNNING | researcher | 14:02 | - | 搜索中... |
| 3 | ⏳ WAITING | executor | - | - | 依赖Step 2 |
| 4 | ⬜ PENDING | - | - | - | - |
### Status Update Rules

- **After each step completes**: Report to user briefly. `Step X/总数 done. [关键结果]`
- **Every 3 steps**: Provide a quick progress summary.
- **When blocked**: Report immediately. Don't wait.
- **Silence is failure**: If a sub-agent hasn't responded within the timeout, assume it's stuck and escalate.

